config BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_MI
	bool "sigmastar-mi"
	help
	  SigmaStar MI multimedia stack: the kernel modules, the userspace
	  libraries mi-player links, and the /config tree mi_sys reads at
	  init. Prebuilt binaries, taken from the vendor SDK and from a
	  dump of this board's own flash. Nothing here is built from source.
